# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the asan-6.9 test preset. Each entry covers a
# report whose allocation stack holds no frame of this project; a leak in
# project code is never suppressed here.

# Qt Quick Controls Material asks QFontDatabase::hasFamily() for its font while
# its plugin registers its types on the QML loader thread. Qt resolves the
# family alias through fontconfig, which parses its configuration then and
# keeps those allocations for the life of the process. Every frame of the
# stack lies in libfontconfig, libexpat and Qt.
leak:QFontconfigDatabase::resolveFontFamilyAlias
